332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (New students and visitors of the campus often struggle to navigate buildings with multiple floors and classrooms. A physical floor plan exists, and there are also some campus maps available to view, but it's difficult to find and to navigate because it is in a fixed position. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Other existing solutions such as Global Positioning Systems \(GPS\) work well outdoors but struggle indoor navigation, which Indoor Positioning Systems \(IPS\) can fill this gap but  require specialized hardware to set up and are expensive to maintain)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Solution: Have a low-cost and scalable way to support digital indoor navigation without relying on external hardware per floor.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
